    'welcome.title': 'How to buy without surprises',
    'welcome.intro.title': 'Welcome',
    'welcome.intro.body': 'Here you buy straight from manufacturers worldwide and we ship to your door. In two minutes we show you the only thing worth knowing before your first order: exactly what you pay, and how to pay less.',
    'welcome.precio.title': 'What you see is what you pay',
    'welcome.precio.body': 'The final price includes the product, shipping, your country tax and customs duties. Nothing else is due when the parcel arrives: not to the courier, not to customs, no handling fees.',
    'welcome.arancel.title': 'Duty goes per declaration line, not per unit',
    'welcome.arancel.body': 'Since July 2026 the European Union charges a flat duty for each line declared at customs. Products of the same kind travel on the same line: add units, or a similar garment, and it stays put; add something of another kind — footwear next to a t-shirt — and it goes up.',
    'welcome.arancel.regla': 'You pay {arancel} per declared line. Several units, and also similar products that are declared alike, count as one.',
    'welcome.envio.title': 'One order, one shipment',
    'welcome.envio.body': 'Shipping is charged per order, not per product. Put everything you want into the same purchase and you pay a single shipping fee. You can also choose express, standard or economy delivery.',
    'welcome.envio.regla': 'The more separate purchases, the more shipping fees. Keeping everything in one is always cheaper.',
    'welcome.tope.title': 'There is a maximum per order',
    'welcome.tope.body': 'The carrier will not accept orders above a certain goods value. If you go over it, drop an item and leave it for another time. That is all: you now know how to buy here.',
